---
---
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/techchainfinance/vxtritontabs.css" />
<div class="vx-triton-tabs-wrap">
  <!-- Tabs -->
  <div class="vx-triton-tabs-nav">
    <button
      class="vx-triton-tabs-btn"
      data-vx-triton-tab="portal"
    >
      PORTAL
    </button>

    <button
      class="vx-triton-tabs-btn is-active"
      data-vx-triton-tab="triton"
    >
      TRITON
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div
    id="vx-triton-panel-portal"
    class="vx-triton-tabs-panel"
  >
    <p>
      Portal acts as the front-facing interface enabling users to manage
      onboarding, documentation, and workflow tracking efficiently.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    id="vx-triton-panel-triton"
    class="vx-triton-tabs-panel is-active"
  >
    <p>
      Triton provides a robust backend engine for underwriting, credit
      evaluation, and loan approval. It integrates seamlessly with LMS
      systems and future-ready modules such as co-lending and refinancing.
      Triton ensures smart credit decisions, reduces manual intervention,
      and provides end-to-end visibility and control over SCF operations.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<script type="module" src="/scripts/techchain/vxtriton.js"></script>